        "revision": 1,
        "meta": {
          "title": "Una comida durante unas vacaciones me dejo con 38 parasitos en el cerebro",
          "source": "BBC Mundo",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.com/mundo/articles/c4gyjnvjd79o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "date_published": "2026-07-06",
          "date_processed": "2026-07-06",
          "tags": [
            "salud",
            "ciencia"
          ],
          "level": "B1-B2"
        },
        "summary_en": "A woman named Lowri suffered for months from puzzling symptoms: severe headaches, seizures and episodes of psychosis. At first, no one understood what was happening to her. After several tests, the doctors discovered the cause: an infection caused by the larvae of the pork tapeworm, which had lodged in her brain. According to the specialists, she was infected by eating contaminated food during a holiday.\n\nThis case, real but uncommon, has drawn the attention of the medical community. The disease, known as cysticercosis, appears when certain parasites reach the body through undercooked meat or contaminated water. Doctors point out that good hygiene and properly cooking food are the best form of prevention. Fortunately, with the right treatment, most patients manage to recover completely.",
        "resumen_es": "Una mujer llamada Lowri sufrio durante meses unos sintomas desconcertantes: fuertes dolores de cabeza, convulsiones y episodios de psicosis. Al principio, nadie entendia que le ocurria. Tras varias pruebas, los medicos descubrieron el origen: una infeccion provocada por las larvas de la tenia del cerdo, que se habian alojado en su cerebro. Segun los especialistas, se contagio al comer alimentos contaminados durante unas vacaciones.\n\nEste caso, real y poco comun, ha llamado la atencion de la comunidad medica. La enfermedad, conocida como cisticercosis, aparece cuando ciertos parasitos llegan al organismo a traves de carne mal cocinada o de agua contaminada. Los medicos recuerdan que una buena higiene y una coccion adecuada de los alimentos son la mejor forma de prevencion. Por suerte, con el tratamiento apropiado, la mayoria de los pacientes logra recuperarse por completo.",
        "vocab": [
          {
            "front": "sintoma",
            "pos": "noun",
            "back": "symptom",
            "example": "El principal sintoma de la gripe es la fiebre.",
            "tier": "B1"
          },
          {
            "front": "dolor de cabeza",
            "pos": "noun",
            "back": "headache",
            "example": "Tengo un dolor de cabeza terrible.",
            "tier": "B1"
          },
          {
